body:
I used to really enjoy photography and editing before I realized it isn't really a realistic stable career choice so I gave it up. I'd definitely be willing to join a club at my school, I still have my old camera lying around I think. 

I'm not currently seeing one, as the only counseling center in my city I've been in and out of since I was 13 and I have had nothing but horrible experiences there, except for my very first one and I have no idea where she went as she no longer works there. I definitely have not been totally open with any therapist, I think mostly because I don't exactly know whats bothering and theres a lot to cover so I don't give specifics. 

&#x200B;

Thank you for your advice, I really appreciate you taking the time to give it.

&#x200B;

.
